      "primaryFieldsExtractable": true,
      "extractionEligible": true,
      "extractionEligibleReason": null,
      "decodingStatus": "partial",
      "transforms": [
        {
          "name": "unpackCardData",
          "expression": "BaseOffset = CardId*7; Origin = DFHackToFloat(MakeDFVector3(V0.xyz, float3(V1.w,V2.w,V3.w))); rows = V1.xyz,V2.xyz,V3.xyz",
          "requires": [
            "Lumen.Cards"
          ],
          "sourceRefs": [
            "part1.cards_ush_get",
            "part1.cards_ush_origin",
            "part1.cards_ush_rot"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "unpackPacked0W",
          "expression": "bVisible=(w>>24)&1; bHeightfield=(w>>25)&1; bFarField=(w>>26)&1; Dir=(w>>16)&0xF; Channel=(w>>20)&0xF; BiasXY=(w&0xFF,(w>>8)&0xFF)",
          "requires": [
            "Lumen.Cards"
          ],
          "sourceRefs": [
            "part1.cards_ush_packbits",
            "part1.cards_ush_axis",
            "part1.cards_ush_channel",
            "part1.cards_ush_vis",
            "part1.cards_ush_hf",
            "part1.cards_ush_ff"
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "unpackMeshCardsAxes",
          "expression": "LocalExtent = ShuffleAxesNoFlip(MeshCardsExtent, PackedMeshCardsAxes); LocalExtent.z = max(LocalExtent.z, 1)",
          "requires": [
            "Lumen.Cards"
          ],
          "sourceRefs": [
            "part1.cards_ush_localextent"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "mathTerms": [
        "7 float4 per card = 112 B semantic stride; the RDG descriptor reports 16 B/element because ResizeStructuredBufferIfNeeded uses 16-B allocation elements (512 elements = 8192 B capacity in this capture, i.e. floor(512/7)=73 cards maximum and, because RoundUpToPowerOfTwo(7N)=512, NumCardEntries in [37,73])",
        "ResLevelToResLevelXYBias is two 8-bit bytes packed in word 0; Packed0W bits 27-31 are unused",
        "PackedMeshCardsAxes bits[0],[3],[6] are sign flips; bits[1:2],[4:5],[7:8] are the axis permutation opcode"
      ],
      "producerSources": [
        "part1.cards_card_fill",
        "part1.cards_card_fillupload",
        "part1.cards_card_alloc"
      ],
      "consumerSources": [
        "part1.cards_ush_get",
        "part1.cards_mc_cons_offset",
        "part1.cards_cards_cons_dl"
      ],
      "gaps": [
        "LWC decode is not byte-exact: MakeDFVector3/DFHackToFloat reconstructs a float from the high/low split, but the exact high/low split function is not expanded here.",
        "PackedMeshCardsAxes opcode meaning (ShuffleAxesNoFlip switch, LumenCardCommon.ush:40-66) is enumerated in source but not reduced to a closed-form table.",
        "Capacity in the capture descriptor is not a live-card count: valid float4 = 7*NumCardEntries; the rounded-up tail is uninitialized/stale.",
        "If r.LumenScene.SurfaceCache.Feedback.HighResPages is off, the high-res fields are still allocated but not used for page mapping."
      ],
